":"何景明","text":"溪上水生三尺深，茅堂清夏气萧森。\n无钱即买扁舟至，系向门前柳树阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1047,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪上水新至漫兴四首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"双飞鸂?恋青莎，对舞蜻蜓爱碧波。\n一夕水风开菡萏，画船齐唱采莲歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1048,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪上水新至漫兴四首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"菡萏风前花不稀，菖蒲雨后叶初肥。\n黄鹂白鹭知人意，来往鸬鹚洲上飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1049,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪上水新至漫兴四首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"碧沙青泥俱可怜，白鲢赤鲤不论钱。\n莫叹邻翁生计拙，买船沽酒过年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1050,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂兴十五首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"野亭千橘未全黄，青杮红梨俱待霜。\n南邻老翁种橡栗，已见儿童收满床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1051,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂兴十五首 其五","author":"何景明","text":"道上高坟古郁林，夕园空锁碧藤阴。\n人言啼鸟多情思，却为谁家作好音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1052,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂兴十五首 其六","author":"何景明","text":"急杵繁砧一郡秋，西风落月万家楼。\n不知塞下征人怨，但见