256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊四首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"三闾大夫不愿醉，五柳先生不愿醒。\n一醒一醉缘何事，坐对寒花烟满庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1072,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊四首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"菊过重阳开更繁，城中车马未曾看。\n种来本是山家物，白露青霜共暮寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1073,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊四首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"槛畔辉辉纤月斜，幽香独立殿年华。\n多情似与诗人约，一夜还开四五花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1074,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊四首 其四","author":"何景明","text":"露委烟斜更有情，黄花紫萼太分明。\n只教秋色常为主，莫遣西风怨落英。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1075,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葡萄二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"晴阑袅袅风须动，暑架垂垂露乳寒。\n却忆高楼清夏日，美人常对水晶盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1076,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葡萄二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"汉家葡萄出西域，斗酒曾博凉州戍。\n当日谁知使者劳，至今人种葡萄树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1077,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简贾司教二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"郭西茅屋带峰峦，竹径花阑亦可看。\n骑马自来还自去，无人知是广文官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1078,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简贾司教二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"古坛双树挺秋烟，废院残花照暮天。\n门外扫除无俗客，我来时复伴青毡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1079,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吾郡古要害地也闲居兴怀追咏古迹作诗八首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"西来一道是淮源，南向千峰尽楚山。\n风云尚拥蛟龙窟，天地曾开虎豹关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1080,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吾郡古要害地也闲居兴怀追咏古迹作诗八首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"寂寂孤城申伯台，废园遗沼尽堪哀。\n繁华惟见东流去，歌舞空传此地来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1081,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吾郡古要害地也闲居兴怀追咏古迹作诗八首 其三","author":"何景明","text":"南山西岭自天来，翠壁丹崖映日开。\n不见当时卧龙者，只今惟有钓鱼台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1082,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]